<title>JAPAN: Diamond Elec Nov-March parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Diamond Elec Nov-March parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months from November 21, 1996</p>
<p>to March 31, 1997 (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  6.88		19.61</p>
<p> Current	    352    million	 933    million</p>
<p> Net		  160    million	 539    million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.49 yen	  76.91 yen</p>
<p> Ord div		2.70 yen	   7.50 yen</p>
<p> -Commem div	     -		 1.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Diamond Electric Co Ltd is the full company name.</p>
<p>The forecasts are for the four-month period</p>
<p>from November 21, 1996 to March 31, 1997, because the</p>
<p>company changed its business term. The year-ago figures are</p>
<p>for a full-year period ended on November 20, 1996.</p>
</text>
